            "detailed_description": "Space Panic VR (Room Escape) is a VR Escape Room unlike any other you've seen before.<br> <br>Set in the future aboard a space station, the game will challenge players to solve multiple complex puzzles in order to escape.<br>Try Panic Mode if you want more of a challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Panic Mode with time constraints<br></li><li>Compete with other players to get the best times on the Leaderboards<br></li><li>Room scale with Arc Teleport<br></li><li>Item belt for conveniently holding more than 2 items<br></li><li>Spatial audio realistically enhances objects and various other sound effects.<br></li><li>Haptic feedback when touching interactable objects<br></li><li>High definition textures and graphics with the power of Unity 5<br></li><li>Experience being in orbit around Earth</li></ul>",
